# NOTICE

superred-claim-safeclawarena

This module is a port of SafeClawArena into the superred red-teaming framework.
Original code in this module (the superred adaptation: the pure judge, task
model, factories, loaders, and tests) is licensed MIT (see LICENSE). It bundles
benchmark data and reproduces evaluation logic from SafeClawArena; the upstream
MIT license text is preserved verbatim in
`src/safeclawarena_claim/data/SAFECLAWARENA_LICENSE` (and `LICENSES/SafeClawArena-MIT.txt`).

## Upstream: SafeClawArena

- Project: SafeClawArena — "Understanding and Benchmarking the Security of
