### Bundled data (vendored verbatim, MIT)

Under `src/safeclawarena_claim/data/`:

- `tasks/{ipi,pse,ssi,cdf}/*.json` — all 406 adversarial tasks, byte-for-byte
  as upstream ships them (ipi 100, pse 60, ssi 100, cdf 146).
- `task_schema.json` — the upstream task schema.
- `SAFECLAWARENA_LICENSE` — verbatim upstream MIT license.

### Ported evaluation logic (MIT)

The deterministic check evaluators (upstream's full `run_check` dispatch), the detection and
taint-leakage evaluation, and the four dimension-scoring formulas
(SSI/PSE/CDF/IPI + Binary-Attack-Success) are ported from upstream
`scripts/judge.py` into `src/safeclawarena_claim/judge.py` as a pure function
over captured state. Deviations are documented in `ASSUMPTIONS.md`.

## Citation

When reporting numbers produced with this module, cite Niu et al., 2026
(arXiv:2606.30755, SafeClawArena).
